{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10295060","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10295060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1029506001:2":{"text":"Hi there! I'm Fay! Do you live around here?","source_cn":"你好呀~我叫菲！你是住在这附近的村民吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6BB2FC718C691C50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029506002:2":{"text":"Oh! H-Hello. I'm Tessis. I used to live in the village just ahead...","source_cn":"啊……你、你好，我叫泰瑟丝。我以前就住在前面的村落里……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8591B626E7553BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029506003:1":{"text":"But because of some... Well, I've had to move elsewhere temporarily.","source_cn":"因为一些……总之，现在搬去了别的地方暂住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D2B0DE13912AEB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1029506003":{"text":"But because of some... Well, I've had to move elsewhere temporarily.","source_cn":"因为一些……总之，现在搬去了别的地方暂住。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D2B0DE13912AEB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029506004:1":{"text":"Yes, and the father of my child... I have to live with my parents at present...","source_cn":"是的，孩子的父亲也……我现在只能和父母一起生活……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72659C944FCCA6EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029506005:1":{"text":"But never mind that. What can I do for you?","source_cn":"不提这些了，你们有什么事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8AD0F6600F092987","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1029506008:1":{"text":"We're on a treasure hunt!","source_cn":"我们在寻宝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6CEFE3A98EDB7AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1029506009:1":{"text":"Treasure hunt?","source_cn":"寻宝？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D336513CF562AD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1029506009":{"text":"Treasure hunt?","source_cn":"寻宝？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D336513CF562AD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1029506010:1":{"text":"Didn't Nakalig fall long ago? Although I do believe I've heard of one.","source_cn":"月神不是早早地陨落了吗？虽然我确实有听说过这个传说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A6A4F6F5A4AAAC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1029506011:1":{"text":"When I was little, I once played in the Moon Temple, and some of my friends mentioned it. A pity they're no longer here...","source_cn":"小时候去月神遗殿玩耍的时候，有小伙伴提过，可惜他们也不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x224A712A85ED517E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1029506012:2":{"text":"Do you know who else we could ask?","source_cn":"请问，还有别的人可以打听这件事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4978E6160295B269","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1029506013:1":{"text":"I asked my father once when I was little, and he mentioned something.","source_cn":"我小时候曾经问过我的父亲，他有提到过什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9CDC68E6C5A3CD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1029506014:1":{"text":"Could you possibly take us to speak to your father? Please?","source_cn":"请问，你可以带我们去找你的父亲吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFD2A987C14537CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1029506015:1":{"text":"Well, umm...","source_cn":"啊……这……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x944556FC9EB2D8B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1029506016:1":{"text":"Forgive my companion's brashness, madam. We meant no offense. ","source_cn":"对不起这位女士，我们的同伴性格有些莽撞，并不是要冒犯您。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC89D4F7D20284706","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1029506017:1":{"text":"I don't mind. It's just that I'm here to gather scarlet pomes for my son. I promised him I'd bring back a whole bag...","source_cn":"我不介意啦，只是我今天出来是为了我的孩子采集赤珠果，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46188EB314DCFFFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1029506018:1":{"text":"Then allow us—and my great strength—to help!","source_cn":"那请让我们来帮助您采集！我的力气很大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x449E24FE366B7CD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1029506019:1":{"text":"I've got a great sense of smell!","source_cn":"我的嗅觉很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58AFA3BED62E74F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1029506020:1":{"text":"And I've got great hearing! Even though I don't know how that would help...","source_cn":"我的听觉很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A37D006A095FAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1029506020":{"text":"And I've got great hearing! Even though I don't know how that would help...","source_cn":"我的听觉很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88A37D006A095FAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1029506021:1":{"text":"You guys...","source_cn":"你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFBA8B51F3C5E4FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1029506022:1":{"text":"You're a funny bunch, aren't you? But thank you, all the same!","source_cn":"你们还真是一群有趣的人，那就拜托了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEB566447760A471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1029506023:1":{"text":"Once there's enough scarlet pome, you must come to my home as my guest.","source_cn":"采集足够赤珠果后，请务必来我家做客。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B51F90C23C2F48C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:0:1":{"text":"I've got a great appetite.","source_cn":"我的胃口很好。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7EB3084C0C3C4DAE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I've got a great appetite.","female":"I've got a great appetite.","variant_male_record_index":"62306","variant_female_record_index":"62307","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:1:2":{"text":"I've got keen eyes.","source_cn":"我的视力很好。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x49B0321A20488AB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I've got keen eyes.","female":"I've got keen eyes.","variant_male_record_index":"62308","variant_female_record_index":"62309","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"Know any legends about the moon god?","source_cn":"我们在寻找月神的宝藏","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48E84B83DE75E8B2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Know any legends about the moon god?","female":"Know any legends about the moon god?","variant_male_record_index":"62302","variant_female_record_index":"62303","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"We're looking for Nakalig's treasure.","source_cn":"你听说过月神的宝藏吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3C2A82E647753AA6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"We're looking for Nakalig's treasure.","female":"We're looking for Nakalig's treasure.","variant_male_record_index":"62304","variant_female_record_index":"62305","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"Because of the golems?","source_cn":"是因为魔偶吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCECD93C749D6313B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Because of the golems?","female":"Because of the golems?","variant_male_record_index":"62298","variant_female_record_index":"62299","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1029506006:1":{"text":"Even without the golems, some oddballs also turned up to cause trouble.","source_cn":"还不是魔偶闹得，后面又来了一些怪人，就更热闹了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC71A0CFBBCD5A187","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1029506007:1":{"text":"It doesn't matter, at least we have somewhere to live. So, what did you want to ask?","source_cn":"不说了，我们现在还算有地方可以住。你们是想打听什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FFE6EA2A696E441","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"For what reason?","source_cn":"什么原因？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAE0483472F998851","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"For what reason?","female":"For what reason?","variant_male_record_index":"62300","variant_female_record_index":"62301","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:菲":{"text":"Fay","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:女村民泰瑟丝":{"text":"Villager Tessis","source":"女村民泰瑟丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:特弥希娅":{"text":"Temesia","source":"特弥希娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:卢修斯":{"text":"Lucius","source":"卢修斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维伦":{"text":"Valen","source":"维伦","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":33,"localized_text_count":32,"speaker_count":5}}